# SCHEDULE — the weekly supper plan.
# weekOffset: 0 = this week, 1 = next week, -1 = last week.
# Day indexes: 0 = Monday … 6 = Sunday.
# Set @recipeId to a recipe that is planned in the week. See README.md.

@weekOffset = 0
@dayIndex = 0
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


# ═══ READ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### READ ONLY — Week plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule?weekOffset={{weekOffset}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Smart defaults (recipes that reached vote consensus, open days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/{{weekOffset}}/smart-defaults
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Fill the gap (well-liked recipes not cooked recently)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/fill-the-gap?weekOffset={{weekOffset}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}


# ═══ PLAN ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### CHANGES DATA — Put @recipeId on @dayIndex
# requireEmpty: true returns 409 instead of replacing a recipe already there.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/assign
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "weekOffset": {{weekOffset}},
  "dayIndex": {{dayIndex}},
  "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
  "requireEmpty": true
}

### CHANGES DATA — Swap @recipeId from one day to another in the same week
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/move
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "weekOffset": {{weekOffset}},
  "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
  "intent": "swap",
  "fromIndex": 0,
  "toIndex": 2
}

### CHANGES DATA — Defer @recipeId to the first free day next week
# Give fromIndex or an exact "sourceDate": "YYYY-MM-DD".
# For a meal already cooked, add "cookedDisposition": "reset" or "preserve".
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/move
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "weekOffset": {{weekOffset}},
  "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
  "intent": "defer",
  "fromIndex": {{dayIndex}}
}

### CHANGES DATA — Lock the week
# Locks every day, clears the week's votes, and updates last-cooked dates.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/lock?weekOffset={{weekOffset}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
